Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, category-sorted summaries, and exact decimal totals formatted as two-digit strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with a stderr message and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing, and README includes a grouped example with expected output.

All 10 supplied tests passed; tests were unchanged. Additional decimal and malformed-CSV checks passed.
